r\n在马克西米利安·吉纳斯手下初次尝到失败的滋味后，又接连二次未能赢过马克斯(马克西米利安)。后与马克斯结婚，婚后名改为米莉亚·法莉娜·吉纳斯，结婚时年龄仅15岁。两年后生下与马克斯的大女儿·柯米莉亚。\r\n\r\n「可曾记得爱」\r\n剧场版中名为米莉亚639。\r\n\r\n「Macross 7」\r\nMacross7船团居住舰City7的市长，49岁。七女儿——米莲·吉纳斯为本作的女主角。\r\n作为政治家也十分有才华，保持着90%以上的支持率。为了保护市民，还曾亲自驾驶VF-1J出击。\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\n「Macross Δ」\r\n六女儿米兰达的女儿，米拉洁·法莉娜·吉纳斯为本作的女主角。米莉亚出现于#05的米拉洁的回忆中。","name":"ミリア・ファリーナ","infobox":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"米莉亚·法莉娜"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"v":"Miriya Sterling"},{"v":"Miriya Parina Sterling"},{"v":"米莉亚·斯特林"},{"k":"婚后名","v":"ミリア・ファリーナ・ジーナス"},{"k":"第二中文名","v":"米莉亚·法莉娜·吉纳斯"},{"k":"英文名","v":"Milia Fallyna Jenius"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"女"}],"stat":{"comments":2,"collects":17},"id":41166,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"female","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/dd/3b/8560_crt_3M0x0.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/dd/3b/8560_crt_3M0x0.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/dd/3b/8560_crt_3M0x0.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/dd/3b/8560_crt_3M0x0.jpg"},"summary":"","name":"パナップ","infobox":[{"key":"性别","value":"女"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"日文名","v":"パナップ"},{"k":"罗马字","v":"Panapp"}]},{"key":"引用来源","value":"anidb.net"}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":2},"id":8560,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"male","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/71/ab/8563_crt_p6j85.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/71/ab/8563_crt_p6j85.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/71/ab/8563_crt_p6j85.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/71/ab/8563_crt_p6j85.jpg"},"summary":"","name":"早瀬隆司","infobox":[{"key":"性别","value":"男"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"罗马字","v":"Hayase Takashi"},{"k":"日文名","v":"早瀬隆司"}]},{"key":"引用来源","value":"anidb.net"}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":1},"id":8563,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"male","b